# Packaged archives of outputs/ and report/, built for sharing.
# The underlying files are tracked individually, so the archive is redundant.
IIH_outputs.zip
*.zip

# R session artefacts
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# PHI — patient identifiers must never reach a remote repository.
# The MRN lists live outside the working tree (/home/user/mrn_lists) and are
# delivered directly to the investigator, never committed.
mrn_lists/
*MRN*.csv
*MRN*.txt

# Raw patient-level extracts. These carry MRNs, dates of birth, diagnosis and
# medication records for identifiable patients and must not reach a remote.
# NOTE: 14 such files are already tracked from earlier commits and are NOT
# removed by this rule - see the note in STATISTICAL_REVIEW_MEMO.md.
data-raw/
